sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]
    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.RemoveAllBonds()
    Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(0)
    Note over App: Removes all stored bonds.<br>The callback always reports 0 as the final<br>bond count, regardless of the previous state.
